1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:07,073
On West Gate Portal, open Users & Access -> Federation Tokens and mint a scoped oscar_fed_ service token.

2
00:00:07,113 --> 00:00:16,325
On Central HQ Node, open Servers in Federation Token mode (HTTPS 443), paste the token, and connect West Gate Portal.

3
00:00:16,365 --> 00:00:31,044
Search Events for container EMCU 141779-0 and click Compare Passes to inspect transits, OCR crops, and waveforms from both portals.

4
00:00:31,084 --> 00:00:51,907
In Report Generator, enable Include correlated passes from federated nodes and generate unified JSON and PDF Vehicle Incident reports.
